<title>USA: Financial Trust raises div to $0.31/shr.</title>
<headline>Financial Trust raises div to $0.31/shr.</headline>
<dateline>CARLISLE, Pa. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.31			   $0.25</p>
<p> Pay	     May 9</p>
<p> Record	  May 3</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Financial Trust Corp.</p>
<p>The company is in a pending merger with Keystone Financial Inc that is expected to be consummated in the second quarter of this year. The increased dividend will, said the coompany, place Financial Trust shareholders on a par with Keystone shareholders.</p>
</text>
